---
layout: layouts/page.liquid
title: About
description: Meet Mitchell Knight and Tonya Knight, the designers behind We Are Knights.
permalink: /about/
---
<p>We Are Knights is a design studio founded by Mitchell Knight and Tonya Knight, working across brand identity, web design, and print.</p>

<div class="about-grid">
  {% for author in authors %}
  <div class="about-tile reveal reveal-item" style="--reveal-index: {{ forloop.index0 }}">
    <a href="/authors/{{ author.id }}/">
      <img src="{{ author.avatar }}" alt="{{ author.name }}">
      <div class="tile-overlay">
        <h3>{{ author.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ author.bio }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
